{"id":2326,"date":"2024-09-19T12:34:59","date_gmt":"2024-09-19T12:34:59","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/?post_type=product&#038;p=2326"},"modified":"2025-10-02T14:52:15","modified_gmt":"2025-10-02T14:52:15","slug":"cardboard-bakery-boxes","status":"publish","type":"product","link":"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/product\/cardboard-bakery-boxes\/","title":{"rendered":"Cardboard Bakery Boxes"},"content":{"rendered":"<h2>Custom Cardboard Bakery Boxes at Wholesale Prices<\/h2>\n<p>Cardboard bakery boxes are essential for safely transporting cakes, pastries, donuts, cupcakes, and baked snacks. Whether you&#8217;re running a bakery, a dessert shop, or selling at farmers\u2019 markets, packaging is just as important as the product inside.<\/p>\n<p>At <a href=\"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/\"><strong>Shop Cardboard Boxes<\/strong><\/a>, we offer <strong>custom cardboard bakery boxes<\/strong> at wholesale prices. Choose from a wide range of sizes, styles, and finishes. Whether you want plain Kraft boxes or full-color printed cake boxes, we\u2019ve got you covered.<\/p>\n<hr \/>\n<h2 data-start=\"463\" data-end=\"526\">Serve Freshness and Presentation with Custom Bakery Boxes<\/h2>\n<h3 data-start=\"527\" data-end=\"572\">Boxes Designed for Transport and Display<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"574\" data-end=\"816\">Baked goods are delicate. That\u2019s why our cardboard bakery boxes are made to offer structure, easy opening, and secure closing. We use high-strength materials that help protect the shape and freshness of your items during delivery or takeaway.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"818\" data-end=\"844\">Available options include:<\/p>\n<ul data-start=\"846\" data-end=\"1051\">\n<li data-start=\"846\" data-end=\"873\">\n<p data-start=\"848\" data-end=\"873\">One-piece folding boxes<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"874\" data-end=\"903\">\n<p data-start=\"876\" data-end=\"903\">Two-piece boxes with lids<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"904\" data-end=\"965\">\n<p data-start=\"906\" data-end=\"965\"><strong data-start=\"906\" data-end=\"940\">Small bakery boxes with window<\/strong> for product visibility<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"966\" data-end=\"1012\">\n<p data-start=\"968\" data-end=\"1012\">Boxes with handles for cupcakes or cookies<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1013\" data-end=\"1051\">\n<p data-start=\"1015\" data-end=\"1051\">Insert trays for donuts or muffins<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p data-start=\"1053\" data-end=\"1112\">Each style is easy to assemble, lightweight, and food-safe.<\/p>\n<h3 data-start=\"1114\" data-end=\"1154\">Ideal for All Types of Bakery Items<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"1156\" data-end=\"1280\">From individual cupcakes to full-sized cakes, we provide <strong data-start=\"1213\" data-end=\"1245\">large cardboard bakery boxes<\/strong> and mini sizes that are ideal for:<\/p>\n<ul data-start=\"1282\" data-end=\"1413\">\n<li data-start=\"1282\" data-end=\"1298\">\n<p data-start=\"1284\" data-end=\"1298\">Pastry shops<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1299\" data-end=\"1324\">\n<p data-start=\"1301\" data-end=\"1324\">Cafes and home bakers<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1325\" data-end=\"1354\">\n<p data-start=\"1327\" data-end=\"1354\">Online dessert deliveries<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1355\" data-end=\"1378\">\n<p data-start=\"1357\" data-end=\"1378\">Catering and events<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1379\" data-end=\"1413\">\n<p data-start=\"1381\" data-end=\"1413\">Bulk packaging for wholesalers<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p data-start=\"1415\" data-end=\"1673\">If you\u2019re also packaging lunch meals, baked sandwiches, or food trays, we offer a dedicated range of <strong data-start=\"1516\" data-end=\"1546\"><a class=\"\" href=\"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/product\/lunch-cardboard-boxes\/\" rel=\"noopener\" data-start=\"1518\" data-end=\"1544\">Lunch Cardboard Boxes<\/a><\/strong> designed for ready-to-eat items. These can be ordered alongside your bakery boxes for a unified look acro