 class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Full cakes or dozen cookies<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Corrugated Cardboard, SBS<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Corrugated: strong, protective, suitable for heavy items; SBS: smooth finish, premium look<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Anti-scratch coating, Eco-coat (biodegradable)<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Foldable design for space-saving, Divider inserts for separating items, Tear strip for easy opening<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Bulk cake boxes, bakery wholesale packaging, party orders<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\"><strong><button class=\"hover:duration-80 duration-800 cursor-pointer text-left align-baseline inline underline decoration-textOff\/25 decoration-1 underline-offset-[5px] animate-underlineFade after:content-[&quot;&quot;] hover:text-super hover:decoration-super\/80 hover:underline-offset-[7px] dark:decoration-textOffDark\/30 dark:hover:decoration-super\/80 transition-all motion-reduce:transition-none appearance-none bg-transparent border-0 p-0 m-0 [td_&amp;]:table-cell align-baseline inline-block align-top\" type=\"button\" data-state=\"closed\">Extra Large<\/button><\/strong><\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">16 x 16 x 6<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Multiple cakes or large batches<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Double-wall Corrugated, SBS<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Double-wall corrugated for extra durability; SBS for premium appearance<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Matte Laminate, UV coating, Eco-friendly varnish<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Reinforced handles, Window panel, Divider inserts, Custom branding options<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Large bakery orders, event catering, wholesale distribution<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\"><strong><button class=\"hover:duration-80 duration-800 cursor-pointer text-left align-baseline inline underline decoration-textOff\/25 decoration-1 underline-offset-[5px] animate-underlineFade after:content-[&quot;&quot;] hover:text-super hover:decoration-super\/80 hover:underline-offset-[7px] dark:decoration-textOffDark\/30 dark:hover:decoration-super\/80 transition-all motion-reduce:transition-none appearance-none bg-transparent border-0 p-0 m-0 [td_&amp;]:table-cell align-baseline inline-block align-top\" type=\"button\" data-state=\"closed\">Custom Sizes<\/button><\/strong><\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Variable<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Custom capacity<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Custom blends (kraft, recycled, SBS)<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Tailored materials based on product needs and sustainability goals<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Custom finishes including embossing, foil stamping<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Custom die-cut shapes, Inserts, Handles, Branding<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Specialized packaging solutions for unique bakery products<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<\/tbody>\n<\/table>\n<p>All boxes can be ordered plain or printed with your logo, brand colors, and product information.<\/p>\n<hr \/>\n<h2>Custom Printing and Food-Safe Materials<\/h2>\n<h3>Food-Grade Printing That Looks and Feels Clean<\/h3>\n<p>We use non-toxic, food-grade inks for all <strong>custom bakery boxes<\/strong>. Choose single-color branding or full-color prints to match your theme, menu, or season.<\/p>\n<table class=\"border-borderMain dark:border-borderMainDark my-[1em] w-full table-auto border\">\n<thead class=\"bg-offset dark:bg-offsetDark\">\n<tr>\n<th class=\"border-borderMain px-sm py-sm dark:border-borderMainDark break-normal border text-left align-top\"><strong>Feature<\/strong><\/th>\n<th class=\"border-borderMain px-sm py-sm dark:border-borderMainDark break-normal border text-left align-top\"><strong>Details<\/strong><\/th>\n<th class=\"border-borderMain px-sm py-sm dark:border-borderMainDark break-normal border text-left align-top\"><strong>Material Options<\/strong><\/th>\n<th class=\"border-borderMain px-sm py-sm dark:border-borderMainDark break-normal border text-left align-top\"><strong>Finishing Choices<\/strong><\/th>\n<th class=\"border-borderMain px-sm py-sm dark:border-borderMainDark break-normal border text-left align-top\"><strong>Add-ons &amp; Features<\/strong><\/th>\n<th class=\"border-borderMain px-sm py-sm dark:border-borderMainDark break-normal border text-left align-top\"><strong>Usage\/Application<\/strong><\/th>\n<\/tr>\n<\/thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\"><strong><button class=\"hover:duration-80 duration-800 cursor-pointer text-left align-baseline inline underline decoration-textOff\/25 decoration-1 underline-offset-[5px] animate-underlineFade after:content-[&quot;&quot;] hover:text-super hover:decoration-super\/80 hover:underline-offset-[7px] dark:decoration-textOffDark\/30 dark:hover:decoration-super\/80 transition-all motion-reduce:transition-none appearance-none bg-transparent border-0 p-0 m-0 [td_&amp;]:table-cell align-baseline inline-block align-top\" type=\"button\" data-state=\"closed\">Printing<\/button><\/strong><\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Color modes: CMYK or Pantone<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Kraft paper (natural brown), Whiteboard (smooth white), Recycled paper (eco-friendly)<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Glossy finish (shiny and vibrant), Matte finish (non-reflective, elegant), UV coating (durable and protective)<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">QR code integration for digital engagement, Custom logo printing, Ingredient lists for transparency<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Retail-ready pastry boxes, bakery packaging, gift boxes<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\"><strong><button class=\"hover:duration-80 duration-800 cursor-pointer text-left align-baseline inline underline decoration-textOff\/25 decoration-1 underline-offset-[5px] animate-underlineFade after:content-[&quot;&quot;] hover:text-super hover:decoration-super\/80 hover:underline-offset-[7px] dark:decoration-textOffDark\/30 dark:hover:decoration-super\/80 transition-all motion-reduce:transition-none appearance-none bg-transparent border-0 p-0 m-0 [td_&amp;]:table-cell align-baseline inline-block align-top\" type=\"button\" data-state=\"closed\">Inside Print<\/button><\/strong><\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Optional internal artwork or branding<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">SBS Board (solid bleached sulfate, premium white), Kraft (natural brown)<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Moisture-resistant coating to protect contents, Food-safe inks<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Hidden messaging for brand storytelling, Internal branding for premium feel<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Upscale dessert packaging, luxury confectionery boxes<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\"><strong><button class=\"hover:duration-80 duration-800 cursor-pointer text-left align-baseline inline underline decoration-textOff\/25 decoration-1 underline-offset-[5px] animate-underlineFade after:content-[&quot;&quot;] hover:text-super hover:decoration-super\/80 hover:underline-offset-[7px] dark:decoration-textOffDark\/30 dark:hover:decoration-super\/80 transition-all motion-reduce:transition-none appearance-none bg-transparent border-0 p-0 m-0 [td_&amp;]:table-cell align-baseline inline-block align-top\" type=\"button\" data-state=\"closed\">Label Ready<\/button><\/strong><\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Blank or pre-branded label options<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Kraft (brown), White (smooth surface)<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Smooth uncoated surface ideal for writing or stamping<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">DIY stamp-friendly surface, Sticker application ready, Customizable for local or handmade products<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Handmade goods packaging, local artisan sales, small batch products<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<\/tbody>\n<\/table>\n<p>If you want to print only your logo or need product labels, we support partial printing or blank boxes with custom sticker placement.<\/p>\n<hr \/>\n<h2>Bulk Orders and Custom Coating Options<\/h2>\n<h3>Choose What Works Best for Your Bakery<\/h3>\n<p>Whether you run a local kitchen or sell in high volumes, we handle <strong>cake boxes bulk cheap<\/strong> with consistency and quick turnaround. Here&#8217;s a breakdown:<\/p>\n<p><strong>Bulk Orders and Add-on Options<\/strong><\/p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th><strong>Feature<\/strong><\/th>\n<th><strong>Details<\/strong><\/th>\n<th><strong>Material Options<\/strong><\/th>\n<th><strong>Finishing Choices<\/strong><\/th>\n<th><strong>Add-ons &amp; Features<\/strong><\/th>\n<th><strong>Usage\/Application<\/strong><\/th>\n<\/tr>\n<\/thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Order Volume<\/strong><\/td>\n<td>100 to 50,000+ units<\/td>\n<td>Corrugated cardboard (single or double wall), Kraft paper (natural or bleached), SBS (Solid Bleached Sulfate)<\/td>\n<td>Matte finish (smooth, non-reflective), Gloss finish (shiny and vibrant), Soft touch (velvety texture)<\/td>\n<td>Handles (rope, die-cut), Custom inserts (cardboard or foam), Window cut-outs (PVC or biodegradable film)<\/td>\n<td>Daily retail orders, Wholesale distribution, Bulk packaging for shipping<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Lead Time<\/strong><\/td>\n<td>Average 7\u201314 business days<\/td>\n<td>Custom stock available upon request<\/td>\n<td>Eco-coating options (biodegradable, water-based)<\/td>\n<td>Auto-lock mechanisms for quick assembly, Fold-flat design for space-saving storage<\/td>\n<td>Bakeries and food distributors, E-commerce packaging, Seasonal promotions and events<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Complimentary Services<\/strong><\/td>\n<td>Provided with all qualifying orders<\/td>\n<td>Food-safe material stocks certified for direct contact, Recyclable and compostable options<\/td>\n<td>Greaseproof coating (ideal for oily\/fatty foods), Water-resistant coating for moisture protection<\/td>\n<td>Design file check and optimization, 3D proofing and digital mock-ups before production, Shipping included on eligible orders<\/td>\n<td>Startups launching new products, Pop-up shops and temporary events, Catering and food delivery services<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<\/tbody>\n<\/table>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<p>We also offer free design consultation, dieline setup, and no plate\/die-cutting charges for standard styles.<\/p>\n<hr \/>\n<h2>Related Products in Food-Related Cardboard Boxes<\/h2>\n<h3>Packaging for Every Food Item You Sell<\/h3>\n<p>If you&#8217;re packaging more than just baked goods, we offer a full category of <strong><a href=\"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/product-category\/food-related-cardboard-boxes\/\">Food-Related Cardboard Boxes<\/a><\/strong>. This includes boxes for:<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Pizza and flatbreads<\/li>\n<li>Chocolates and candies<\/li>\n<li>Hot dog trays<\/li>\n<li>Sandwich packaging<\/li>\n<li>Cardboard snack boxes<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>Each product is custom-sized and comes with the same range of printing, coating, and delivery options as our bakery boxes.<\/p>\n<hr \/>\n<h2>How to Order Cardboard Bakery Boxes with Us<\/h2>\n<h3>Simple and Fast Process<\/h3>\n<p>You don\u2019t need to manage packaging alone. Just follow these steps:<\/p>\n<ol>\n<li>Pick your size, design style, and material<\/li>\n<li>Send your branding files or request design help<\/li>\n<li>Receive a free digital mockup or 3D visual<\/li>\n<li>Confirm the order and delivery schedule<\/li>\n<li>Get free shipping directly to your location<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<h3>Why Choose Shop Cardboard Boxes<\/h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Bulk discounts on <strong>cardboard bakery boxes wholesale<\/strong><\/li>\n<li>Custom options for <strong>large cardboard bakery boxes<\/strong><\/li>\n<li>Quick service and nationwide delivery<\/li>\n<li>Coating options: Gloss, Matte, Spot UV<\/li>\n<li>Food-grade materials and non-toxic inks<\/li>\n<li>Free shipping and design services included<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>Let us know what your bakery needs. From cupcake containers to full cake carriers, we\u2019ll deliver packaging that looks clean and works as expected. Start your quote today.<\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Need durable, stylish boxes for your bakery treats? Our cardboard bakery boxes are the perfect solution. Customize your boxes with your logo and branding for a professional look. We offer fast turnaround times and free design and shipping services. Order now and enjoy high-quality packaging at wholesale prices!<\/p>\n","protected":false},"featured_media":2450,"template":"","meta":{"_joinchat":[]},"product_brand":[],"product_cat":[183],"product_tag":[],"class_list":["post-2326","product","type-product","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","product_cat-food-related-cardboard-boxes","rishi-post","first","instock","shipping-taxable","purchasable","product-type-simple"],"yoast_head":"<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO plugin v27.9 - https:\/\/yoast.com\/product\/yoast-seo-wordpress\/ -->\n<title>Order Custom Cardboard Bakery Boxes , Wholesale Price<\/title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"High-quality cardboard bakery boxes for packaging cakes, pastries, and other baked goods. Customizable with your brand logo and design.\" \/>\n<meta n